<section x-data="settingsPage"><div class="page-heading"><div><h1>Pengaturan siklus & kategori</h1><p>Atur bulan penilaian, jadwal, dan kategori hasil. Seluruh waktu ditampilkan dalam WIB.</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary" @click="edit()"><x-icon name="plus"/>Tambah periode</button></div><x-page-state empty="!rows.length" title="Belum ada periode" message="Siapkan periode dan kategori agar Kepala Unit dapat mulai menilai."/><div x-cloak x-show="!loading && !loadError && rows.length"><div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Bulan penilaian</th><th>Batas pengisian</th><th>Batas keputusan KD</th><th>Status</th><th>Tindakan</th></tr></thead><tbody><template x-for="row in rows" :key="row.id"><tr><td><strong x-text="ui.month(row.assessment_month)"></strong><span class="subtext" x-text="'Tutup: '+ui.dateTime(row.closes_at)"></span></td><td x-text="ui.dateTime(row.submission_due_at)"></td><td x-text="ui.dateTime(row.approval_due_at)"></td><td><x-badge/></td><td><div class="button-row"><button class="btn btn-small" @click="edit(row)">Lihat / ubah</button><button class="btn btn-small" x-show="row.status!=='closed'" @click="closeCycle(row)">Tutup periode</button></div></td></tr></template></tbody></table></div><x-pagination/></div><div class="notice mt-5"><strong>Jadwal dan kategori periode terpakai dilindungi</strong>Setelah penilaian pertama dibuat, jadwal dan kategori tidak dapat diubah. Periode masih dapat ditutup. Pengecualian tenggat dan pembukaan ulang menunggu kebijakan lanjutan.</div>
<dialog class="wide-dialog" x-ref="cycle" @click.self="!busy && $el.close()"><form class="dialog-body" @submit.prevent="save()"><div class="dialog-header"><h2 x-text="editingId?'Pengaturan periode':'Tambah periode penilaian'"></h2><button class="icon-button" type="button" :disabled="busy" @click="$refs.cycle.close()" aria-label="Tutup pengaturan"><x-icon name="close"/></button></div><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="cycle-month">Bulan yang dinilai</label><input id="cycle-month" type="month" x-model="form.assessment_month" required></div><div class="field"><label for="cycle-status">Status periode</label><select id="cycle-status" x-model="form.status"><option value="planned">Terjadwal</option><option value="open">Dibuka</option><option value="closed">Ditutup</option></select></div><template x-for="field in dates" :key="field[0]"><div class="field"><label :for="field[0]" x-text="field[1]+' (WIB)'"></label><input :id="field[0]" type="datetime-local" x-model="form[field[0]]" required><p class="field-error" x-text="errors[field[0]]?.[0] || ''"></p></div></template></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-center justify-between mt-7 mb-4"><h3>Kategori hasil</h3><button class="btn btn-small" type="button" @click="exampleCategories()">Isi usulan 70 / 80 / 90</button></div><p class="muted small mb-4">Batas bawah termasuk, batas atas tidak termasuk. Mulai dari 0 tanpa celah; kosongkan batas atas kategori terakhir. Tombol usulan mengisi contoh untuk ditinjau.</p><div class="category-list"><template x-for="(category,index) in form.categories" :key="index"><div class="category-row"><div class="field"><label :for="'category-code-'+index">Kode</label><input :id="'category-code-'+index" x-model="category.code" required maxlength="32"></div><div class="field"><label :for="'category-label-'+index">Nama kategori</label><input :id="'category-label-'+index" x-model="category.label" required maxlength="90"></div><div class="field"><label :for="'category-lower-'+index">Batas bawah</label><input :id="'category-lower-'+index" x-model="category.lower_bound" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.000001" required></div><div class="field"><label :for="'category-upper-'+index">Batas atas</label><input :id="'category-upper-'+index" x-model="category.upper_bound" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.000001" placeholder="Tanpa batas"></div><button type="button" class="icon-button" :disabled="form.categories.length===1" @click="form.categories.splice(index,1)" :aria-label="'Hapus kategori '+(index+1)"><x-icon name="trash"/></button></div></template></div><button class="btn mt-4" type="button" @click="addCategory()"><x-icon name="plus"/>Tambah kategori</button><div class="notice notice-error mt-4" x-show="formError" role="alert"><p x-text="formError"></p><template x-for="(messages,key) in errors" :key="key"><p class="small mt-1" x-text="messages[0]"></p></template></div><div class="dialog-footer"><button type="button" class="btn" :disabled="busy" @click="$refs.cycle.close()">Batal</button><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" :disabled="busy" x-text="busy?'Menyimpan…':'Simpan pengaturan'"></button></div></form></dialog></section>
